wJû parovnta me kataxiwðsai prosdevxasqai thún uJmetevran
 <COL N="0106A"></COL> ajpostolikhún aJgiwsuvnhn. Periú gaúr twðn prokeimevnwn, hætoi twðn
proteqevntwn kataú twðn qespismavtwn twðn ojrqodovxwn patrwðn,
