thðû qeovthtoû aujtouð kaiú taú thðû ajnqrwpovthtoû. 3Allo ti
mhú</FOREIGN>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paradecovmenoi paraú tav ejk twðn aJgivwn oijkoumenikwðn
tessavrwn sunovdwn khrucqevnta, kaiú thðû pevmpthû thðû
