 <COL N="0165C"></COL> dihnekwðû uJmaðû, prosmevnein twðé lovgwé thðû cavritoû,
eijû toú, paðsan pareisenevgkasqai spoudhún, twðé kaq1</FOREIGN> 
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ujmaðû uJpodeivgmati, kaiú pavntaû eujzhlwvtwû metapoihðsai
