uJp1 ejmeú sunovdou oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><COL N="1255C"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kuprianoúû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Klaudioupolitwðn
mhtropovlewû thðû 2Onwriatwðn ejparc., uJpeúr ejmautouð kaiú
thðû uJp1 ejmeú sunovdou oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Iwavnnhû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivskopoû thðû Pisinountievwn
mhtropovlewû thðû deutevraû twðn Galatwðn ejparcivaû,
uJpeúr ejmautouð kaiú thðû uJp1 ejmeú sunovdou oJm. uJpeshmhnavmhn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Poluveuktoû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Murevwn mhtropovlewû
thðû Lukivwn ejparc., uJpeúr ejmautouð kaiú thðû uJp1 ejmeú
sunovdou oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Qeovdwroû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Stauroupolitwðn mhtropovlewû
thðû Karwðn ejparc., uJpeúr ejmautouð kaiú thðû uJp1
ejmeú sunovdou oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Tibevrioû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivskopoû thðû Laodikevwn mhtropovlewû
 <COL N="1255D"></COL> thðû Frugwðn ejparcivaû Pakatianwðn, uJpeúr
ejmautouð kaiú thðû uJp1 ejmeú sunovdou oJmoivwû uJpeshmhnavmhn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kosmaðû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivskopoû thðû sunnadevwn mhtropovlewû
