thðû Lukaovnwn ejparc., oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Stevfanoû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivskopoû thðû 1Antiocevwn mhtropovlewû
thðû Pisidwðn ejparc., uJpeúr ejmautouð kaiú thðû
uJp1 ejmeú sunovdou oJm. uJpeshm.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1255"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Iwavnnhû ejlevwé Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Pergevwn mhtropovlewû
