. . . . . Diospolitwðn, mhtropovlewû thðû 2Onarivstwn
ejparcivaû oJrivsaû uJpevgraya</FOREIGN> .</P> <P COM="1259"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Poluvdektoû ejlevei Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû. Murevwn mhtropovlewû
thðû Lukivwn ejparc. oJrivsaû uJpevg</FOREIGN> .</P> <P COM="1259"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Qeavtwroû ejlevei Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Stauropovlewn mhtropovlewû
thðû 2Hbrwðn ejparc. oJr. uJpevg</FOREIGN> .</P> <P COM="1259"><COL N="1259B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Tibevrioû ejlevei Qeouð ejpisk. thðû . . . . . . . Laodikevwn
mhtropovlewû thðû Frugwðn ejparc. oJrivsaû uJpevgraya</FOREIGN> .</P> <P COM="1259"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kosmaðû ejlevei Qeouð ejpivskopoû thðû Sumbadivwn mhtropovlewû
thðû Saloutarivwn ejparcivaû oJrivsaû uJpevgr</FOREIGN> .</P> <P COM="1259"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kwnstantiðnoû ejlevei Qeouð ejpivsk. thðû Bhúr, mhtropovlewû
